    "norm": "Verifies that {@code iso.until(sym454)} returns {@link Period#ZERO}. <p>The {@code until} method on {@link LocalDate} converts the target to a {@link LocalDate} internally. When {@code sym454} and {@code iso} share the same epoch-day, no elapsed period separates them, so the result must be {@link Period#ZERO}."
